cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "formant-extraction-skill"
abstract: >
  A bundle of Claude skills that drive a monolingual American English
  interview pipeline from raw audio to a vowel-formant CSV: Whisper +
  ECAPA-TDNN transcription and diarization, FAVE/MFA or BAS WebMAUS
  forced alignment, and FAVE-extract or headless Praat formant
  extraction. Runs in Claude Cowork (desktop) or Claude Code (CLI / IDE).
